    //  The font picker on the Theme page: the typeface the shell is drawn in for the chosen theme (Glass: Space Grotesk, Retro: Better VCR, unless picked
    //  otherwise), as a dropdown with a picture of the typeface under it. A scene cannot change its font while it runs, so Apply saves the choice and
    //  starts the shell again (see `bin/vitreus-fonts`). The list has eight rows at a time and the wheel moves it (`font_top`, in the logic).
    text font_for = "Font for Glass"
